       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose looks like it might be a mistake.\n\n**Amlodipine 50 mg by mouth once daily is 5 times the maximum recommended dose.** Typical adult dosing is 2.5\u201310 mg once daily, and 10 mg/day is the maximum. A 50 mg daily dose would carry a serious risk of severe low blood pressure, reflex tachycardia, and swelling. This range is the same regardless of the patient's weight, so being 70 kg doesn't change it.\n\nThis looks like it could be a typo for **5 mg**, a common starting dose. Can you confirm which you meant?\n\n1. **Amlodipine 5 mg PO once daily**\n2. **Amlodipine 10 mg PO once daily**\n3. **Another dose**: if you really do intend more than 10 mg/day, please confirm and give the clinical reason. I'll add it as a note on the order so pharmacy can review it.\n\nOnce you reply, I'll enter the order."
